    <!--
        Milestone 3 - homepage content (minimal, founder-focused).

        Website 1's homepage (ir.ui.view id 1297, website.page id 5, url
        "/") is a full standalone website-builder page with key
        "website.خانه" - NOT the generic "website.homepage" template, and
        it has no ir.model.data external id of its own (confirmed: no row
        in ir.model.data for model=ir.ui.view res_id=1297). <template
        inherit_id="..."> resolves via an external id lookup, so it cannot
        target this view by its key string directly.

        Fix: give the existing view a stable external id,
        theme_eot_custom.eot_home_view_ref (metadata only - it does not
        touch the view's own content/history), and inherit from that.

        The external id is created by migrations/20.0.3.0.1/pre-migrate.py,
        NOT by an <record model="ir.model.data"> here: that XML form only
        works on the first load; on every later upgrade Odoo finds the id
        already pointing at an ir.ui.view and aborts ("found record of
        different model"). The migration looks the view up by its key and
        website, inserts only if missing, and the row is noupdate so the
        module's end-of-upgrade cleanup never touches it (or the view).

        Replaces the page's oe_structure wrap wholesale: this page is a
        full standalone website-builder page, not a shared layout
        template, so a full content replacement is the task itself, not
        the sweeping-layout-edit the README warns against.

        Milestone 8 redesign (approved "Direction I" on the canvas: day
        version, Talkspace palette, Direction D fonts). Sections, top to
        bottom: hero (no photo; colour field + grid, stats strip, three
        pillars), sister-brand strip, founder, "by EOT" paths, books band,
        articles, closing statement. Copy is verbatim from the previous
        homepage. Styles: .eot-h-* in static/src/scss/theme.scss.
    -->
